[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3242055237","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110159#issuecomment-3242055237","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110159","id":3242055237,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BPdZF","user":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-01T11:45:24Z","updated_at":"2025-09-01T11:45:24Z","body":"This is expected.\n\nAs you may already know, the Godot editor _is_ a Godot game. So the `TranslationServer` under the control of the editor. In this case, translation is disabled by the editor's translation preview feature when you're not previewing any translation.\n\nIf you do want to use `TranslationServer` features, you can create a custom `TranslationDomain` instead.\n\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends EditorScript\n\nfunc _run():\n\tvar translation = Translation.new()\n\ttranslation.locale = TranslationServer.get_locale()\n\ttranslation.add_message('ALERT_NAME','goooooood')\n\tvar domain = TranslationServer.get_or_add_domain(\"phymagi\")\n\tdomain.add_translation(translation)\n\tprint(domain.translate('ALERT_NAME'))\n\tdomain.remove_translation(translation)\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3242055237/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3242144066","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110159#issuecomment-3242144066","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110159","id":3242144066,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BPzFC","user":{"login":"phymagi","id":26023426,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDIzNDI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26023426?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phymagi","html_url":"https://github.com/phymagi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phymagi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phymagi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phymagi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phymagi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phymagi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phymagi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phymagi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phymagi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phymagi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-01T12:17:03Z","updated_at":"2025-09-01T12:17:03Z","body":"@timothyqiu  Thanks for your answer.My plugin works correct now.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3242144066/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0